WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.034 --> 00:00:01.924
- And who knew you could
make beans desserts?

00:00:01.924 --> 00:00:05.152
Why have I not been
making beans into dessert?

00:00:14.776 --> 00:00:16.157
I love the moon and I love cake.

00:00:16.157 --> 00:00:17.214
- I like astronauts.

00:00:17.214 --> 00:00:18.324
- How could this go wrong?

00:00:18.324 --> 00:00:20.708
- It sounds just colorful
and magical and happy.

00:00:28.908 --> 00:00:30.920
- If this tastes like
half the effort that looks

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.830
like that went into
making it, it's gonna be

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:33.968
amazing.

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:35.796
- So beautiful, look at it.

00:00:35.796 --> 00:00:37.990
- It's a egg? Ew.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:38.884
- I got the one with the big egg.

00:00:38.884 --> 00:00:39.880
- It's an egg?

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:40.611
- Is it gonna be good?

00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:41.302
- Not bad.

00:00:41.302 --> 00:00:43.171
- Whoah, I actually really like it.

00:00:43.171 --> 00:00:45.508
- I didn't know lotuses
could be better, they're

00:00:45.508 --> 00:00:47.031
already so beautiful.

00:00:47.031 --> 00:00:49.388
- If it gets too buttery
around the tongue, this tea

00:00:49.388 --> 00:00:51.115
really washes it down quite nicely.

00:00:52.525 --> 00:00:54.467
- Okay, I'm skeptical of the red bean.

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.255
- Well, I've had mochi
with red bean in it,

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:57.149
it's pretty good.

00:00:57.149 --> 00:00:58.409
- Also delicious.
- Mm-hm.

00:00:58.409 --> 00:00:59.669
- It's like super earthy.

00:00:59.669 --> 00:01:01.578
- Less crumble to deal
with because there's no

00:01:01.578 --> 00:01:03.834
like center of cake.

00:01:03.834 --> 00:01:05.439
- Pretty damn good sugar bean.

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:09.360
- Ooh
- Date sounds really good.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.558
- Smells like meat.

00:01:10.558 --> 00:01:11.981
- Ooh, kinda bittery.

00:01:11.981 --> 00:01:15.008
- It's like a super thick fig newton.

00:01:16.238 --> 00:01:17.304
- Yeah.

00:01:17.304 --> 00:01:19.051
- Tastes like really old barbecue sauce.

00:01:19.051 --> 00:01:21.591
- Still good, my least favorite.

00:01:23.341 --> 00:01:24.801
- It was some baller (mumbles)

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:27.239
- It was beautiful, like I
felt bad cutting into them.

00:01:27.239 --> 00:01:28.763
- A snack fit for a queen.

00:01:28.763 --> 00:01:29.921
- I'm a go with the red bean.

00:01:29.921 --> 00:01:32.257
- The lotus one was the best one for sure.

00:01:32.257 --> 00:01:34.614
- I love the tea with
it, I feel really cozy.

00:01:34.614 --> 00:01:36.320
- I just feel like so calm.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:37.925
- I would love to bring this to my family.

00:01:37.925 --> 00:01:39.226
- Can we just start doing this?

00:01:39.226 --> 00:01:40.668
Can we just get together
- We should

00:01:40.668 --> 00:01:41.745
- and have tea and cakes together?

00:01:41.745 --> 00:01:42.355
- a little tea time?

00:01:42.355 --> 00:01:42.964
- I love this.

00:01:45.714 --> 00:01:48.348
If the queen of England visited East Asia,

00:01:48.348 --> 00:01:52.312
this is the ceremony you'd
want to bring her to.

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:53.224
- Moon cake and tea.

00:01:53.224 --> 00:01:55.304
- Moon cake and tea, she'd
be like right in her element.

